        "original_id": "7c21a5bf-1173-5623-8398-e1c07cc41e6d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"What Lovers Do\", 1.22.03.Acoustic\n- People: Adam Levine, Jesse Carmichael, Mickey Madden, James Valentine, Matt Flynn, PJ Morton\n- Organizations: Maroon 5\n- Places: Hit Factory, New York\n- Concepts: singles, studio albums, live EPs\n\nFacts:\n- 1.22.03.Acoustic is a live EP by the Californian band Maroon 5.\n- 1.22.03.Acoustic was named for the date it was recorded live at the Hit Factory in New York.\n- \"What Lovers Do\" was released on August 30, 2017, as the third single from Maroon 5's upcoming sixth studio album.\n- Maroon 5 currently consists of lead vocalist Adam Levine, keyboardist and rhythm guitarist Jesse Carmichael, bassist Mickey Madden, lead guitarist James Valentine, drummer Matt Flynn, and keyboardist PJ Morton.",
